# Git is converting everything to CRLF on checkout on this machine, which is
# harmless for the web files and fatal for two things.
#
# gradlew is a shell script run by a Unix shell on a Mac or in CI. With CRLF
# line endings the shebang line ends in a carriage return and the whole thing
# fails with "bad interpreter: no such file or directory" - a confusing error
# a long way from its cause.
*.sh      text eol=lf
gradlew   text eol=lf

# Binary, and never to be line-ending converted or diffed as text.
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jks     binary
*.keystore binary
*.aab     binary
*.apk     binary
*.jar     binary
